#ASSERT `2026 c 12 s 16 subsection 490(2) as amended by section 3 of 2026, c. 12 applies to the matter or proceeding` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING


§ `2026 c. 15 s. 11.1`

#ASSERT `2026 c 15 s 11.1(1) the clarification applies to the person's communication of the statement` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- wilful promotion of hatred: the clarification does not reach it (the text's "if"), a marginal reading; not a statement of public interest: not covered.
#ASSERT `2026 c 15 s 11.1(1) the clarification applies to the person's communication of the statement` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `2026 c 15 s 11.1(1) the clarification applies to the person's communication of the statement` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `2026 c 15 s 11.1(1) the clarification applies to the person's communication of the statement` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `2026 c 15 s 11.1(2) the clarification applies to the person's communication of the statement` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `2026 c 15 s 11.1(2) the clarification applies to the person's communication of the statement` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `2026 c 15 s 11.1(2) the clarification applies to the person's communication of the statement` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `2026 c. 19 ss. 87 and 96`

#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 87 the operation of the minimum punishment is affirmed following the enactment of section 718.4` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 87 the operation of the minimum punishment is affirmed following the enactment of section 718.4` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 96: "sections 97 to 118" -- both ends in; 118.1 is a different section, 96 and 119 are outside: not covered (no "only").
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 the definitions apply in the section` 97 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 the definitions apply in the section` 118 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 the definitions apply in the section` 96 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 the definitions apply in the section` 118.1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 the definitions apply in the section` 119 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 Act` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 Act` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- commencement day: the 30th day after the day of royal assent.
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 commencement day` (Date 10 1 2027) EQUALS Date 9 2 2027
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 commencement day` (Date 31 1 2027) EQUALS Date 2 3 2027
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 commencement day` (Date 1 12 2027) EQUALS Date 31 12 2027
#ASSERT `2026 c 19 s 96 commencement day` (Date 2 12 2027) EQUALS Date 1 1 2028

